CUSTOM EXCEPTIONS - USAGE REFERENCE (ClicKart project)
========================================================

Package: com.clicKart.exception

exception/
├── ResourceNotFoundException.java      -> 404 Not Found
├── BadRequestException.java            -> 400 Bad Request
├── DuplicateResourceException.java     -> 409 Conflict
├── ResourceOwnershipException.java     -> 403 Forbidden
├── InvalidOperationException.java      -> 409 Conflict
├── ErrorResponse.java
└── GlobalExceptionHandler.java


1. WHEN TO USE WHICH EXCEPTION
--------------------------------------------------

Question                                            -> Exception
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Does the resource exist?                            -> ResourceNotFoundException (404)
Is the input itself malformed/missing/invalid?       -> BadRequestException (400)
Does it belong to someone else?                      -> ResourceOwnershipException (403)
Would creating it duplicate something unique?        -> DuplicateResourceException (409)
Is the resource in a state that blocks this action?  -> InvalidOperationException (409)


